==Elfdalian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|dlc}} {{m|non|einn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|dlc}} {{m|gem-pro|*ainaz}}. Cognate with {{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|sv|en}}.

===Article===
