# [[a]], [[an]]

===Numeral===
{{head|dlc|numeral|g=m}}

# [[one]]

====Usage notes====
The masculine and feminine forms are used only together with a following noun. When used alone (such as when counting), the neuter form {{m|dlc|iett}} is used instead.

